- **F17 — UPHOLD:** The census supports eight missing INTSTAT/INTMASK cells and the revised disclosure.
- **F18 — UPHOLD:** Under the stated floor, the additional narrow-width × reset-bit restriction is clause (e); low repair cost does not itself make it mandatory.
